[{"content":"\r新刊出せました！ Dr.レイシオのエロトラ本。無事発行できました～！\nイベントで手に取ってくださった皆さんありがとうございました！\nエロトラ本と言いつつ触手しか描いてないので、\nどこかでリベンジしたい気持ちありつつ。\nboothにも残部を出しているのでよろしくお願いします。\n―――――――――――――――――\n2026.10.21追記\n増版しました！\n次はレイシオ触手本2を出すぞ…！\n1月インテは厳しいけどお友達が作業通話してくれるらしいので春コミかGWかな～\n","date":"2025.11.17","externalUrl":null,"permalink":"/posts/20251117_acrylic/","section":"Posts","summary":"","title":"11/16 スパーク新刊出たよ～","type":"posts"},{"content":"","date":"2025.11.17","externalUrl":null,"permalink":"/posts/","section":"Posts","summary":"","title":"Posts","type":"posts"},{"content":"","date":"2025.11.17","externalUrl":null,"permalink":"/","section":"えいむ | illustration \u0026 fanworks","summary":"","title":"えいむ | illustration \u0026 fanworks","type":"page"},{"content":"\rレイシオのアクスタbooth開けました https://eeeim8.booth.pm/items/7296309\r自分用に作ったアクスタちょっとだけ出してます！\n自立するミニサイズでかわい～！\n11/16東京と1/11大阪インテにも余れば持っていくよ\n","date":"2025.08.14","externalUrl":null,"permalink":"/posts/20250814_acrylic/","section":"Posts","summary":"","title":"アクリルスタンド通販始めました","type":"posts"},{"content":"","externalUrl":null,"permalink":"/authors/","section":"Authors","summary":"","title":"Authors","type":"authors"},{"content":"","externalUrl":null,"permalink":"/categories/","section":"Categories","summary":"","title":"Categories","type":"categories"},{"content":"","externalUrl":null,"permalink":"/series/","section":"Series","summary":"","title":"Series","type":"series"},{"content":"","externalUrl":null,"permalink":"/tags/","section":"Tags","summary":"","title":"Tags","type":"tags"}]